  "shared_mechanics": [
    "Qualified targets are controlled activated or triggered stack abilities whose exact source is currently a creature/artifact, or whose latest departure facts satisfy that type. Physical source control is independent of ability control.",
    "Copy the complete owned ability packet, assign one fresh stack ID and copied controller, retain physical source/program/origin/mode/X/groups/divisions/paid and linked contexts. No physical source object is allocated or moved.",
    "Reuse existing optional target editing and exact committed target acquisition. New choices remain legal and groups retain their cardinality; inherited illegal targets may remain. Loki observes final acquisition for retained and changed targets.",
    "Copied abilities do not pay activation costs again. Later resolution choices remain independent. New reflexive triggers are fresh triggered abilities, and ability-copy abandonment cannot exile a physical source.",
    "A local activation announcement freezes post-payment source facts before its source leaves during payment; packets use exact incarnation identity."
  ],
  "gated_whole_obligations_pending": [
    "Echo printed vigilance combat and complete own-cost/timing/suppression matrix.",
    "Scientist own-turn, once-per-turn, life-payment boundary, control/origin and turn-reset matrix.",
    "Final whole-card admission, cross-card aggregate and natural-game/performance acceptance."
  ],
